{"step_index":320,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:16:58Z","thinking":"**Constructing Docker Setup**\n\nOkay, I'm now crafting the `docker-compose.yml` and `.env.example` files within the `codeduel/` project directory, as specified in section 56. I'm focusing on the Docker requirements. I'm working to include frontend, backend, MySQL (with health checks and volume), Redis (with health checks and volume), and environment variables configuration. I'm focusing on getting the Docker setup structured correctly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"version: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # MySQL Database Service\n  mysql:\n    image: mysql:8.0\n    container_name: codeduel-mysql\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD:-rootpassword}\n      MYSQL_DATABASE: ${MYSQL_DATABASE:-codeduel}\n      MYSQL_USER: ${MYSQL_USER:-codeduel_user}\n      MYSQL_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD:-codeduel_pass}\n    ports:\n      - \"${MYSQL_PORT:-3306}:3306\"\n    volumes:\n      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"mysqladmin\", \"ping\", \"-h\", \"localhost\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 10\n\n  # Redis Cache & Matchmaking Queue Service\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: codeduel-redis\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"${REDIS_PORT:-6379}:6379\"\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"redis-cli\", \"ping\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 10\n\n  # Spring Boot Core Engine Backend\n  backend:\n    build:\n      context: ./backend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: codeduel-backend\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    depends_on:\n      mysql:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      redis:\n        condition: service_healthy\n    environment:\n      SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE: prod\n      SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL: jdbc:mysql://mysql:3306/${MYSQL_DATABASE:-codeduel}?createDatabaseIfNotExist=true&useSSL=false&allowPublicKeyRetrieval=true\n      SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME: ${MYSQL_USER:-codeduel_user}\n      SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD:-codeduel_pass}\n      SPRING_DATA_REDIS_HOST: redis\n      SPRING_DATA_REDIS_PORT: 6379\n      JWT_SECRET: ${JWT_SECRET:-404E635266556A586E3272357538782F413F4428472B4B6250645367566B5970}\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n\n  # React Frontend Service\n  frontend:\n    build:\n      context: ./frontend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: codeduel-frontend\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    depends_on:\n      - backend\n    environment:\n      VITE_API_URL: http://localhost:8080/api\n      VITE_WS_URL: http://localhost:8080/ws\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:80\"\n\nvolumes:\n  mysql_data:\n  redis_data:\n","Description":"Docker Compose configuration for Backend, Frontend, MySQL, and Redis","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\docker-compose.yml","toolAction":"Creating docker-compose.yml","toolSummary":"Write docker-compose.yml"}}]}
